<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan rated a hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan rated a hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of J.P. Morgan with a hold recommendation.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan shares were off 1-3/4 at 102-3/4 in early trade Thursday.</p>
